# Ergon backbone

Ergon is how Chronos work stays visible. Linear is retired: never read, file or update work there. Full rules: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) §3.

- **Before starting:** search Chronos issues (team `COA` / project Chronos); **dedup** before creating; set **In Progress** when you start.
- **While working:** comment findings/blockers; link the PR; set **In Review** when the PR is open.
- **Done** only when **merged and verified** — never mark broken or incomplete work Done.
- Do not invent open architecture decisions. Privacy pre-flight is still mandatory for egress/AI.
- **Owner-owned UI** tickets (home, logo, multi-repo UX, etc.): wait for owner direction before implementing UI.
